WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:44.120
It's hatching!

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:54.330
It has no core!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.290
What do you mean, it has no core?

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:27.630
It developed armor.

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:31.160
These things are indisputably losing their weaknesses through evolution,

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:34.230
in response to our attacks.

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:35.570
Marlene, what do we do?

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:37.610
Blue still can't move right after they've emerged.

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:42.240
We'll get our contact with Second Earth taken care of now, while we can!

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:19.120
Joey, the auxiliary power!

00:03:22.690 --> 00:03:23.820
Please work!

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:37.700
All right!

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:43.010
Communications angle 2-3-0-8! Level 1-3-6!

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:58.320
This is the Far East Region Recovery Squad, Team Gran Seil.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:03:59.990
Headquarters, please respond!

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.860
Joey, can't you raise the output any higher?

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:10.260
Marlene, this is all it has!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:14.710
This is Team Gran Seil. Headquarters, please respond! Can you hear me?

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.270
This is the Far East Region Recovery Squad...

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:20.610
This is Lucifer's Hammer Headquarters.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:24.680
We have acknowledged your transmission.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:42.900
Baikonur Base, in Russia, acknowledged.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:43.560
Marlene...!

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:44.870
Do not interfere!

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:50.900
Shit, what happened!? It's no use, I can't get it back!

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.910
Auxiliary power just cut out!

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.580
It's too soon for those Blue from before to have started moving...

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:57.910
Well, then...

00:04:57.990 --> 00:04:59.420
Are there others!?

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:12.270
If other Blue have come, then this place is dangerous! We're evacuating!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.600
Marlene, a rescue party will be coming, right?

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:15.600
What do you mean?

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:17.610
What do I mean?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.940
Then you weren't contacting Second Earth to call in a rescue party!?

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:26.350
Our first purpose in contacting them was to report our survival.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:29.940
It was not to request a rescue party.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:34.080
Joey, the other remaining recovery squads have started gathering together.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:38.890
Just like in the advance action manual, we're heading for Baikonur Space Base.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:41.290
Baikonur Space Base...

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:49.700
So then, what about Yung and the others!?

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:51.540
It's close!

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:03.510
Yuji, get out of there!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:33.170
Ah, M- Marlene!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:35.970
Let's go!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.720
Let's go, Yuji.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.620
Joey, get outside!

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:40.410
Marlene, we're sandwiched in!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:48.480
Come with me, Joey!

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:09.470
What is it?

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.590
Aw, shit!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:27.930
Joey, this one's shielding its core too!

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.230
These armor-evolved Blue are being born one after another!

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.360
Look out!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:48.920
Marlene!

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:58.550
Yuji, keep holding it down like that!

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:00.890
Damn you!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:09.900
Joey!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:16.000
Joey! Are you okay!? Joey!

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:26.940
Y- yeah... Are you all... right?

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:37.190
Yuji... If ever someone says they have a friend...

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:45.930
they would have to mean... somebody like you...

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:59.880
Hey, Joey! Get up! You can't die!

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.780
JOEY!!

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.230
Yuji, let's go.

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:31.910
Marlene, Joey is dead! How can you be so indifferent!?

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.570
Hurry up!

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.570
We've had it now!

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:17.290
So, Joey's gone...

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:19.620
Both Armor Shrike units are badly damaged.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.960
Robert, all we can do now is fight here.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:26.430
Marlene, gather the townspeople to this place!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:30.300
Just what are you planning to do?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.240
There's only one place they can enter here.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:41.580
If we can lure the Blue in, we'll have the advantage in battle.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.580
Lure?

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.920
You're using everyone as bait!?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:49.790
Marlene, what do you think the people here are, anyhow?

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.950
They aren't your tools, you know!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.460
The people left on Earth are already dead...

00:12:57.530 --> 00:13:00.260
is that really true, after all, Marlene!?

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:05.870
Okay then, do you have a way to save this population?

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.270
At least with this strategy,

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:13.710
the possibility of some of the residents surviving is better than zero.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.620
By now,

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.680
you should realize the situation we're in.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.290
We're going to intercept the Blue now!

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:35.630
Doing what we instruct you to do is your only remaining means of survival.

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:39.540
Yung!

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.570
Mister!

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:46.240
Yung, you remember what I told you, right?

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:48.580
Mm-hmm.

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:53.250
It's okay, Yung. You've got me here with you. Don't worry!

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.380
Mmm...

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:19.270
Marlene, missed shots will mean our extermination. Do not fail us!

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:19.940
Right!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:20.950
Okay, Maru.

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:28.780
You don't have to worry about smelling like people any more. Run far away now!

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:38.700
It's dangerous here, go somewhere else! If you stay here, you'll be in danger!

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:44.300
Maru, go away! Go, I tell you!

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.800
Hurry up! Go somewhere else!

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:54.070
Maru...

00:14:57.650 --> 00:15:00.950
Yuji... the population here, they're all...

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:07.260
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:11.560
Yung... Yung, I'll be sure to protect you!

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:15.470
They're here!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.550
Is this one of the Blue that shields its core!?

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:40.890
Yuji, aim for its eyes!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:41.830
G- got it!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.500
Bastard!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.820
Marlene, get on!

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:19.260
Get behind it!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:20.300
Leave that to me!

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.880
Yuji, let's finish it!

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:33.210
You got it!

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.540
Mister!

00:16:39.290 --> 00:16:42.090
Go for the eyes! Get us around beside it!

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:57.900
Let's go one more time!

00:16:57.970 --> 00:16:59.070
Yuji!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:40.580
Yung...

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:51.350
I wish Yung could go to sleep for a long time, too.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:55.420
When you're asleep, even the Blue aren't scary, right?

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:05.240
Yung, don't worry. No matter what happens, I will protect you, Yung.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.370
Really?

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:26.150
YUNG!!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:38.100
It's over, Robert. We'll use the explosive and annihilate them all at once!

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:45.100
Marlene, the explosive is already set.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:47.550
I will draw the Blue toward me.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:48.510
Robert!

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:59.490
Your orders are to get Yuji to the Station. Do not forget that.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:47.860
Yung...

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:50.910
We're off to Baikonur, Yuji!

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:38.880
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:45.010
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:54.160
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:54.280 --> 00:22:00.330
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:06.750
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:13.940
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:19.100
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:19.200 --> 00:22:25.160
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:31.440
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:38.920
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:45.780
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:54.890
Joey... Robert... Yung...

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:59.230
Even now, I am tormented by seeing you repeatedly in my dreams...

00:22:59.300 --> 00:23:02.890
However, the same was true for her.

00:23:02.970 --> 00:23:05.460
With her heart closed to her detestable past,

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:09.240
and the present she can't escape, even if she wanted to.

00:23:09.310 --> 00:23:12.510
Even so, we are still alive.
